      "end": 734.37
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel much better now.",
      "asr_range": [
        1200,
        1205
      ],
      "start": 734.61,
      "end": 736.29
    },
    {
      "en": "Thanks, Daniel.",
      "asr_range": [
        1205,
        1207
      ],
      "start": 736.53,
      "end": 738.05
    },
    {
      "en": "Hello, ladies and gentlemen.",
      "asr_range": [
        1241,
        1245
      ],
      "start": 795.07,
      "end": 796.91
    },
    {
      "en": "Today we have invited Professor Stone to talk about the role of elderly people in our society.",
      "asr_range": [
        1245,
        1262
      ],
      "start": 797.47,
      "end": 805.39
    },
    {
      "en": "Welcome to our show, Professor Stone.",
      "asr_range": [
        1262,
        1268
      ],
      "start": 805.63,
      "end": 808.51
    },
    {
      "en": "To begin with, I'd like to tell a story from my own life.",
      "asr_range": [
        1268,
        1281
      ],
      "start": 808.75,
      "end": 813.5
    },
    {
      "en": "Several years ago, when my grandparents were well into their eighties, they were no longer able to care for themselves very well.",
      "asr_range": [
        1281,
        1303
      ],
      "start": 813.74,
      "end": 822.46
    },
    {
      "en": "My grandfather was afraid of leaving the only home they had known for the past sixty years.",
      "asr_range": [
        1303,
        1320
      ],
      "start": 823.1,
      "end": 830.46
    },
    {
      "en": "The idea of having to sell their home and move into a retirement home was an extremely painful experience for them.",
      "asr_range": [
        1320,
        1341
      ],
      "start": 830.7,
      "end": 838.94
    },
    {
      "en": "Indeed, old age for them and many older Americans can mean not only the possible failure of one's health, but the loss of identity and self-worth.",
      "asr_range": [
        1341,
        1368
      ],
      "start": 839.53,
      "end": 851.77
    },
    {
      "en": "Yes, it's true.",
      "asr_range": [
        1368,
        1371
      ],
      "start": 852.31,
      "end": 853.91
    },
    {
      "en": "What do you have to say about the problem of old age?",
      "asr_range": [
        1371,
        1383
      ],
      "start": 854.15,
      "end": 858.31
    },
    {
      "en": "Many experts have given talks here that have focused on the medical care and the development of public services for senior citizens.",
      "asr_range": [
        1383,
        1405
      ],
      "start": 858.79,
      "end": 867.67
    },
    {
      "en": "Today, I'd like to focus my comments on the meaningful roles the elderly can play and should play in our society.",
      "asr_range": [
        1405,
        1426
      ],
      "start": 868.25,
      "end": 877.53
    },
