      ],
      "start": 952.31,
      "end": 961.43
    },
    {
      "en": "Talking about personal relationships, well, I'd naturally think of my relationship with my mother.",
      "asr_range": [
        1648,
        1662
      ],
      "start": 1012.36,
      "end": 1020.58
    },
    {
      "en": "Whenever I need help, my mother is always there for me.",
      "asr_range": [
        1662,
        1673
      ],
      "start": 1020.82,
      "end": 1025.62
    },
    {
      "en": "She often tells me that I can be anyone I want, as long as I'm confident of myself.",
      "asr_range": [
        1673,
        1691
      ],
      "start": 1025.86,
      "end": 1033.69
    },
    {
      "en": "She sees my talent and pushes me to do the best I possibly can.",
      "asr_range": [
        1691,
        1705
      ],
      "start": 1033.93,
      "end": 1039.77
    },
    {
      "en": "As I was growing up, we were often on the move.",
      "asr_range": [
        1705,
        1716
      ],
      "start": 1040.01,
      "end": 1043.85
    },
    {
      "en": "I had to admit that moving so often made me feel lonely, but my mother did everything she could to help me feel happy.",
      "asr_range": [
        1716,
        1740
      ],
      "start": 1044.69,
      "end": 1055.65
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, so much travelling was really a good thing because it made us close.",
      "asr_range": [
        1740,
        1755
      ],
      "start": 1055.89,
      "end": 1062.53
    },
    {
      "en": "I respect my mother so much, as she never treats me as a child, but as an equal.",
      "asr_range": [
        1755,
        1773
      ],
      "start": 1063.21,
      "end": 1071.05
    },
    {
      "en": "She gives me the freedom to make mistakes and to learn from them all.",
      "asr_range": [
        1773,
        1787
      ],
      "start": 1071.29,
      "end": 1076.81
    },
    {
      "en": "Unlike friendships that can fade or break, I know I'll always be connected to my mother no matter what I face.",
      "asr_range": [
        1787,
        1808
      ],
      "start": 1077.51,
      "end": 1087.83
    },
    {
      "en": "She is not just a role model, but someone I love.",
